00:46:36.320 --> 00:46:40.480
Maybe I'm a lazy bookkeeper that didn't notice a bunch of goods coming from God knows where.

00:46:40.620 --> 00:46:42.040
Or maybe I'm just plain stupid.

00:46:42.280 --> 00:46:44.080
You are going way over the top on this.

00:46:44.280 --> 00:46:46.760
Over the top? I have barely left the launch pad.

00:46:46.780 --> 00:46:53.950
Dr. Marcus, shut up. I don't care whether you knew or not.

00:46:54.610 --> 00:46:56.310
That is not what this conversation is about.

00:46:57.250 --> 00:46:59.110
