What we learned from the explosion...

00:52:35.308 --> 00:52:36.268
I know how to do it now.

00:52:38.796 --> 00:52:39.436
to make it work.

00:52:48.812 --> 00:52:51.052
How long till we reach Starbase 26?

00:52:52.236 --> 00:52:53.236
three days.

00:52:55.436 --> 00:52:56.276
Three days.

00:53:34.252 --> 00:53:34.752
Carol

