I was just about to call you.

00:53:38.796 --> 00:53:41.116
I'm beaming over for a final debriefing with Withrow.

00:53:41.868 --> 00:53:42.588
You should come along.

00:53:43.564 --> 00:53:44.604
We could have...

00:53:45.356 --> 00:53:46.356
Dinner.

00:53:47.436 --> 00:53:48.196
I'm sorry.

00:53:48.524 --> 00:53:49.144
