00:55:08.188 --> 00:55:09.188
The holiest thing.

00:55:10.748 --> 00:55:14.208
come up with a different approach, the genesis of something entirely new.

00:55:14.508 --> 00:55:16.348
I can't turn my back on that now.

00:55:16.764 --> 00:55:19.884
And you're here saving the Quadrant every 10 minutes.

00:55:19.884 --> 00:55:21.164
You can do your research.

00:55:21.212 --> 00:55:23.212
