00:55:31.690 --> 00:55:35.780
No. No! Don't you dare, James Kirk! You would hate me forever!

00:55:35.820 --> 00:55:38.630
Hate you? I love you! Don't you understand?

00:55:39.090 --> 00:55:44.960
I do. All too well. But in five, ten, a hundred...

00:55:45.000 --> 00:55:49.740
100 years from now, you're gonna wake up and realize all that you've lost by being with me.

00:55:49.860 --> 00:55:51.810
All you were meant to do.

00:55:52.010 --> 00:55:56.000
And you'll hate yourself for it and me and it'll kill me.

00:55:56.140 --> 00:55:59.110
I won't have that, Jim. I won't.

00:56:01.180 --> 00:56:03.490
You have your world, I have mine.

00:56:04.460 --> 00:56:06.080
We can't exist in the same orbit.

00:56:06.610 --> 00:56:08.570
I suppose that's one possible outcome.

00:56:09.550 --> 00:56:10.810
But it should be my choice.

00:56:11.920 --> 00:56:13.020
Our choice.

00:56:15.040 --> 00:56:18.730
Yes, and I just made it.

00:56:24.170 --> 00:56:24.990
I do love you, Jim.

00:56:26.270 --> 00:56:27.030
All my heart.

00:56:28.630 --> 00:56:29.970
But I am asking you to...

00:56:30.120 --> 00:56:38.020
