00:57:42.950 --> 00:57:45.250
We'll always be the Enterprise.

00:57:48.980 --> 00:57:55.740
I, buddy, A, C, or D.

00:57:59.020 --> 00:57:59.980
For the voyages, Lassie.

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:00.380
