00:58:51.480 --> 00:58:53.080
Blasphemers must be punished.

00:58:53.830 --> 00:58:54.910
I came here to help you now.

00:58:55.910 --> 00:58:59.720
I defy the law of the Oracle by seducing.

00:59:00.190 --> 00:59:02.650
Our high priestess and spying on us.

00:59:02.730 --> 00:59:04.110
A lot of good people died.

00:59:05.080 --> 00:59:06.540
Right now, diplomacy doesn't interest me.

00:59:07.910 --> 00:59:08.650
Justice does.

00:59:09.050 --> 00:59:12.910
The Assyria and the Oracle are always together, ruling from the shadows.

00:59:13.800 --> 00:59:14.900
Now the shadows are gone.

